          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I got diagnosed with ADHD as a kid.</p><p>I didn't want to live on medication as an adult, so I went looking for another way.</p><p>I spent years reading about nootropics and adaptogens and testing combinations on myself.</p><p>I had also stopped drinking around then.</p><p>So when I finally landed on a formula that worked, I noticed it did more than help me focus.</p><p>It made being around people feel easy. The thing alcohol used to do for me at parties, this did better — and I remembered the whole night.</p><p>That formula became SocialVia.</p>",
